  },
  {
    "id": 1016004020170,
    "speaker": "千雪",
    "text": "あの時、リストのことを千雪の世界、って\r\nおっしゃってくれましたね",
    "charAnim1": "shy2",
    "charAnim2": "face_wait",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_wait",
    "charLabel": "chiyuki",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "charPosition": {
      "x": 568,
      "y": 640,
      "order": 0
    },
    "charEffect": {
      "type": "to",
      "alpha": 1,
      "time": 100
    },
    "voice": "produce_events/101600402/1016004020170"
  },
  {
    "id": 1016004020180,
    "speaker": "千雪",
    "text": "……とっても嬉しかったです",
    "charAnim1": "touch",
    "charAnim2": "face_close2",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_wait",
    "charLabel": "chiyuki",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/101600402/1016004020180"
  },
  {
    "id": 1016004020190,
    "speaker": "千雪",
    "text": "でも、だからこそ……",
    "charAnim2": "face_sad",
    "charAnim3": "no",
    "charAnim3Loop": false,
    "charAnim4": "eye_right",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_wait",
    "charLabel": "chiyuki",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/101600402/1016004020190"
  },
  {
    "id": 1016004020200,
    "speaker": "千雪",
    "text": "アルストロメリアを初めて聴く人に、\r\n私が色をつけたものを正解だって思ってほしくない……",
    "charAnim1": "wait4",
    "charAnim2": "face_sad",
    "charAnim4": "blank",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_wait",
    "charLabel": "chiyuki",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/101600402/1016004020200"
  },
  {
    "id": 1016004020210,
    "speaker": "千雪",
    "text": "アルストロメリアは、聴く人の数だけ違う世界で……\r\n違う咲き方をしてほしい……って思ってしまって……",
    "charAnim1": "anger2",
    "charAnim2": "face_sad",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_wait",
    "charLabel": "chiyuki",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/101600402/1016004020210"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "……なるほどな",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "千雪が解説をつけて出してしまうと余計、\r\nそれが正解だ、って方向に進みそうだもんな……",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "charAnim3": "yes",
    "charAnim3Loop": false,
    "charLipAnim": "lip_wait_s",
    "charLabel": "chiyuki",
    "textFrame": "off",
    "waitType": "time",
    "waitTime": 2000
  },
  {
    "id": 1016004020220,
    "speaker": "千雪",
    "text": "プレイリストが宣伝材料になること、\r\n初めて聴く人に指針があった方がいいこともわかるんです",
    "charAnim1": "wait2",
    "charAnim2": "face_sad",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_wait",
    "charLabel": "chiyuki",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/101600402/1016004020220"
  },
  {
    "id": 1016004020230,
    "speaker": "千雪",
    "text": "なので、心苦しいんですけど……",
    "charAnim2": "face_close",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_wait",
    "charLabel": "chiyuki",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/101600402/1016004020230"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "大丈夫だ、千雪",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "charAnim1": "wait3",
    "charAnim2": "blank",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_anger2_s",
    "charLabel": "chiyuki",
    "textFrame": "off",
    "waitType": "time",
    "waitTime": 1500
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "千雪の感じ方にひかれて、\r\nアルストロメリアのファンになった人もたくさんいる",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "千雪が抵抗感がある企画は……\r\nその人達にも受け入れられないんじゃないかな",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "charAnim1": "sad2",
    "charAnim2": "face_wait",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_wait_s",
    "charLabel": "chiyuki",
    "textFrame": "off",
    "waitType": "time",
    "waitTime": 2000
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "……何か、他の方法を探してみよう",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "id": 1016004020240,
    "speaker": "千雪",
    "text": "ありがとうございます、プロデューサーさん",
    "charAnim1": "surp1",
    "charAnim2": "face_close2",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_wait",
    "charLabel": "chiyuki",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
